# The language bar, made honest.
#
# This repository is mostly prose: at 76c7b4b the markdown was 1,387,104 B across 82 files
# against 1,126,238 B of TypeScript and JavaScript. GitHub's bar showed only the code, so a
# reader saw a small TypeScript project and not the specification that the code answers to.
#
# Marking the prose as prose is what makes the bar say what the tree actually is. The code is
# already detectable and stays that way; nothing here hides anything.
*.md   linguist-documentation
*.mdx  linguist-documentation
